{"GrafanaProm ability path does not preserve the ruler-backed permission/support model - update/delete/export/pause/restore/silence now depend on different folder/type/support checks while list data may lack ruler metadata": 0.8542811870574951, "AlertRuleMenu now computes canPause, canDelete, canDuplicate, canSilence, and canExport by OR-ing ruler-based abilities with GrafanaProm-based abilities, which broadens permissions for non-list callers that still pass rulerRule": 0.8858116269111633, "GrafanaGroupLoader drops ruler-side fallback and no longer shows placeholders for rules being created or deleted but not yet propagated to Prometheus, breaking correctness during propagation delays": 0.9080830812454224, "GrafanaGroupLoader removes the diagnostic warning logging for mismatches between Prometheus and ruler data": 0.48898422718048096, "GrafanaRuleListItem no longer falls back to rulerRule.grafana_alert.is_paused for pause state, causing potential disagreement between row status and actual backend state": 0.7413848638534546, "RuleActionsButtons returns null if getEditableIdentifier() cannot build an identifier, which can suppress action UI entirely for valid items when promRule doesn't satisfy the grafana.rule predicate": 0.8762912154197693, "Grafana-managed rules can be identified through either ruler-derived or Prometheus-derived identifiers depending on DTO path, causing the same rule to serialize, compare, or gate actions differently": 0.771282434463501, "useGrafanaPromRuleAbility/useGrafanaPromRuleAbilities skip checks entirely when passed skipToken instead of returning a supported-but-not-allowed result, which is a structural deviation from the Ruler-based hook pattern": 0.474916934967041, "FilterView always passes Prometheus rule object into GrafanaRuleListItem without rulerRule, preventing distinction between ruler-backed versus prom-backed identity for Grafana-origin results": 0.5956204533576965, "Delete menu item is shown when canDelete is true but click handler guards on isEditableRuleIdentifier(identifier), creating a mismatch where delete affordance may do nothing when clicked for GrafanaProm-backed rows": 0.7255500555038452}